Description: ForSys is a multi-objective spatial prioritization system that was designed to explore how specific investment strategies aimed at improving forest conditions change under a range of management constraints to achieve specific outcomes and understand tradeoffs. ForSysXR package allows to run ForSysX from R, mixing the fast ForSysX algorithm with the flexibility of ForSysR.
